  {
    "id": "topic_01",
    "title": "Chủ đề 1 - Tin nhắn điện thoại",
    "type": "topic",
    "theory": [
      {
        "slide_index": 4,
        "text": [
          "<strong><span style=\"color: #9381C7;\">CHỦ ĐỀ 01: </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">TIN NHẮN ĐIỆN THOẠI</span></strong>",
          "<em><span style=\"color: #EC95AC;\">Hi, </span></em><em><span style=\"color: #7030A0;\">Ms. Nguyet</span></em><em><span style=\"color: #EC95AC;\">. This is </span></em><em><span style=\"color: #7030A0;\">Tung</span></em><em><span style=\"color: #EC95AC;\"> from </span></em><em><span style=\"color: #7030A0;\">River English  Center</span></em><em><span style=\"color: #EC95AC;\">.</span></em>"
        ]
      },
      {
        "slide_index": 5,
        "text": [
          "<strong>NỘI DUNG TỔNG QUÁT</strong>",
          "• <span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> Tình huống của các bài nghe về tin nhắn điện thoại thường là khi </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">bạn gọi điện cho một người nào đó mà người này không có mặt để nghe điện thoại </span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">của bạn, thì bạn có thể </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">để lại lời nhắn </span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">của bạn trong máy điện thoại cho người đó. </span>",
          "• <span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> Hầu hết các tin nhắn điện thoại đều sẽ </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">mở đầu bằng một lời chào</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">. Tiếp theo, người gọi sẽ tự </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">giới thiệu bản thân </span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">là ai, trước khi đi vào nội dung chi tiết mục đích của cuộc gọi. Sau cùng là </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">đề cập đến một số yêu cầu </span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">được đưa ra cho người nghe. </span>"
        ]
      },
      {
        "slide_index": 6,
        "text": [
          "• <span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> Câu hỏi về người gọi thường sẽ là:</span>",
          "• <em>Who most likely is the caller/ the speaker? </em>",
          "• <em>Where does the speaker/ the caller work? </em>",
          "<em>👉🏻 </em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">Đáp án thường xuất hiện ở </span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">câu lời chào và tự giới thiệu</span></strong><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">.</span>",
          "• <span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> Câu hỏi về mục đích cuộc gọi thường sẽ là &quot;</span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">What is the purpose of the call?</span></strong><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">&quot; </span>",
          "<em><span style=\"color: #F79646;\">👉🏻 </span></em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">Đáp án thường xuất hiện trong </span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">đoạn mục đích cuộc gọi</span></strong><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, thường sẽ xuất hiện các cụm từ: </span>",
          "• <em>I&#x27;m calling to ask/ see if ...</em>",
          "• <em>I&#x27;m calling to let you know that ... </em>",
          "• <em>I&#x27;m calling about/ regarding ... </em>"
        ]
      },
      {
        "slide_index": 7,
        "text": [
          "• <span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> Câu hỏi về yêu cầu của người gọi đối với người nghe ví dụ như: </span>",
          "• <em>What is Mr. Watkins asked to do?</em>",
          "• <em>What is the listener asked to do?</em>",
          "• <em>What does the speaker ask the listener to do? </em>",
          "<span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> 👉🏻 Đáp án trả lời cho các câu hỏi này thường sẽ nằm ở </span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">nửa phần sau của bài nghe</span></strong><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">. </span>"
        ]
      },
      {
        "slide_index": 8,
        "text": [
          "• <strong>This is + </strong><strong>tên</strong><strong> + (from ...) </strong>",
          "• <em><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">This is </span></strong></em><em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">Dana</span></em><em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, one of your truck drivers.</span></em>",
          "• <em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">Hi, Mr. Watkins, </span></em><em><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">this is</span></strong></em><em><strong><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> </span></strong></em><em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">Lewis Philips</span></em><em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> from Lambert Technologies. </span></em>",
          "• <em><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">This is </span></strong></em><em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">John</span></em><em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> with CNN News. </span></em>",
          "• <strong> I’m calling to ...</strong>",
          "• <em><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">I&#x27;m calling to let you know </span></strong></em><em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">I&#x27;m having a problem with transportation.</span></em>",
          "• <em><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">I&#x27;m calling to see if </span></strong></em><em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">you have any plan for the weekend.</span></em>",
