          "• <em><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">Please call me </span></strong></em><em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">back at 555 - 9873.</span></em>",
          "• <em><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">Please call me </span></strong></em><em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">back if you have the chance. Thanks! </span></em>"
        ]
      }
