    "id": "topic_02",
    "title": "Chủ đề 2 - Thông báo",
    "type": "topic",
    "theory": [
      {
        "slide_index": 60,
        "text": [
          "<strong><span style=\"color: #9381C7;\">CHỦ ĐỀ 02: </span></strong>",
          "<strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">THÔNG BÁO</span></strong>",
          "<em><span style=\"color: #EC95AC;\">Attention </span></em><em><span style=\"color: #7030A0;\">employees</span></em><em><span style=\"color: #EC95AC;\">. I have </span></em><em><span style=\"color: #7030A0;\">a quick announcement</span></em><em><span style=\"color: #EC95AC;\">. </span></em>"
        ]
      },
      {
        "slide_index": 61,
        "text": [
          "<strong>NỘI DUNG TỔNG QUÁT</strong>",
          "• <span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> Phần này thường tập trung vào </span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">những thông báo trong nội bộ trong công ty </span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">như: </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">thông báo về nhân sư</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">̣, </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">thông báo về chính sách mới</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">thông báo về kế hoạch hoạt động</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">thông báo sửa chữa văn phòng</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, ... </span>",
          "• <span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> Ngoài ra, cũng có </span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">những thông báo ở nơi công cộng nhu</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">̛: </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">tại sân bay</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> (hoãn, huỷ chuyến bay), </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">tại cửa hàng </span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">(chương trình khuyến mãi, thông báo thay đổi thời gian kinh doanh), </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">tại thư viện</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">tại nhà hàng</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">khách sạn</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">trung tâm mua sắm</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">nhà ga</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, ... </span>",
          "• <span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">Thông báo trong nội bộ công ty thường bắt đầu với các cụm từ như: </span><em><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">Attention employees</span></em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, </span><em><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">Hi everybody</span></em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, </span><em><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">May I have your attention please? </span></em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">để thu hút sự chú ý của người nghe. Tiếp theo đến </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">chủ đê</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">̀, </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">mục đích</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">nội dung chi tiết</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> của thông báo. Cuối cùng, bài thông báo sẽ đưa ra một số </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">yêu cầu </span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">cho người nghe. </span>"
        ]
      },
      {
        "slide_index": 62,
        "text": [
          "<strong>NỘI DUNG TỔNG QUÁT</strong>",
          "• <span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> Với các bài nghe về thông báo trong nội bộ công ty, thường sẽ có câu hỏi &quot;</span><em><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">What is the purpose of the announcement?</span></em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">&quot;. </span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">Đáp án thường nằm ở những câu đầu tiên của bài thông báo</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">. </span>",
          "• <span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> Với các bài nghe về thông báo ở nơi công cộng, thường sẽ có câu hỏi về </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">đối tượng người nghe</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> hoặc </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">địa điểm </span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">của bài thông báo, </span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">đáp án nằm ở những câu đầu tiên của bài thông báo</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">. </span>"
        ]
