          "<strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">M:</span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> </span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(1)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">I&#x27;d like to introduce our new branch manager, Ms. Susan Lee</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. One of Ms. Lee&#x27;s priorities is to secure our position as the leading bank in our community. </span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(2)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">She hopes to accomplish this by providing affordable loans to local businesses to help them grow</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. </span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(3)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">I know you&#x27;d all like to find out more</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. We only have the room until two o&#x27;clock, but Ms. Lee will be starting work here full time on Monday, so you can contact her any time after that. </span>"
