        "transcript": [
          "<strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">M:</span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> Good evening, and thank you all for attending tonight&#x27;s fashion show here at JC Design School. </span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(1)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">We&#x27;re holding this special event to show off the beautiful garments created by our most recent group of trainees</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. These talented young people participated in a six-month training course, where they learned to create the clothing items you&#x27;ll see here tonight. </span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(2)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Many of these garments were made with unconventional fabrics, which you can read about in the leaflets that are being passed around</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. And after the show, you&#x27;re welcome to stay and talk with our graduating trainees. </span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(3)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">They&#x27;ll answer any questions you may have about their designs and creations</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. </span>"
        ]
      }
