    "id": "topic_03",
    "title": "Chủ đề 3 - Quảng cáo",
    "type": "topic",
    "theory": [
      {
        "slide_index": 114,
        "text": [
          "<strong><span style=\"color: #9381C7;\">CHỦ ĐỀ 03: </span></strong>",
          "<strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">QUẢNG CÁO</span></strong>",
          "<em><span style=\"color: #EC95AC;\">Looking for </span></em><em><span style=\"color: #7030A0;\">a great place to eat</span></em><em><span style=\"color: #EC95AC;\">? </span></em>"
        ]
      },
      {
        "slide_index": 115,
        "text": [
          "<strong>NỘI DUNG TỔNG QUÁT</strong>",
          "• <span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> Các bài nghe quảng cáo thường gặp là </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">quảng cáo giảm giá</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">khuyến mãi</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">giới thiệu sản phẩm mới</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> hoặc </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">quảng cáo về dịch vụ</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">. </span>",
          "• <span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> Các câu hỏi quảng cáo chủ yếu hỏi về:</span>",
          "• <em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">Sản phẩm được quảng cáo</span></em>",
          "• <em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">Đối tượng mà quảng cáo hướng đến </span></em>",
          "• <em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">Mục đích của quảng cáo </span></em>",
          "• <em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">Đặc tính của sản phẩm, dịch vụ</span></em>"
        ]
      },
      {
        "slide_index": 116,
        "text": [
          "<strong>NỘI DUNG TỔNG QUÁT</strong>",
          "• <span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> Quảng cáo thường bắt đầu với </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">một câu hỏi </span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">nhằm thu hút sự chú ý của người nghe. Ví dụ: </span>",
          "• <em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">Are you looking for ...?</span></em>",
          "• <em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">Are you frustrated because ...? </span></em>",
          "• <em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">Looking for a great ... to ...? </span></em>",
          "• <span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> Tiếp theo, bài quảng cáo mới nói về </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">đặc tính</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">ưu điểm</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">ưu đãi của mặt hàng</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">dịch vụ</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">. Cuối cùng là cách để mua sản phẩm hoặc cách để nhận thông tin thêm về sản phẩm. </span>"
        ]
      },
      {
        "slide_index": 117,
        "text": [
          "<strong>NỘI DUNG TỔNG QUÁT</strong>",
          "• <span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> Với dạng bài nghe quảng cáo, thường sẽ có câu hỏi về nội dung/ chủ đề của bài quảng cáo (</span><em><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">What is being advertised?/ What type of service is being advertised?</span></em><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">) và </span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">đáp án thường xuất hiện ở nửa đầu bài nghe</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">. </span>",
          "• <span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> Phần giữa bài nghe thường đề cập đến </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">đặc tính sản phẩm</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">giá cả</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">ưu đãi</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">, ... của sản phẩm hay dịch vụ được quảng cáo. </span>",
          "• <span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> Phần nửa cuối bài nói thường đề cập đến </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">cách thức để đặt hàng</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\"> hoặc </span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">lấy thêm thông tin</span><span style=\"color: #0070C0;\">. </span>"
        ]
      }
    ],
