          "<strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">W:</span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> </span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(1) </span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Does your fitness tracker take too much effort to use?</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> Well, not anymore with the Health Monitor, which is worn around your wrist like a watch. </span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(2) </span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">With most wearable devices, you have to push a button in the middle of your exercise routine to access your heart rate tracker or to see how many calories you&#x27;ve burned</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. Who wants to do that? </span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(2) </span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The Health Monitor will automatically display these features on its screen so you can see this information easily without interrupting your workout</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. Plus, </span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(3) </span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">the price of the Health Monitor has been reduced by ten percent for the next month in honor of its debut on the market, so order one now</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">! </span>"
        ]
