        "transcript": [
          "<strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">W:</span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> Thanks for tuning in to today&#x27;s health show. I have a question for my listeners. Have you been wanting to lower your sugar intake but just can&#x27;t resist that sweet snack at the local cafe? </span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(1)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Today, I&#x27;II teach you about an eating program that will stop your cravings permanently</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. I used this program to lower my sugar intake, and it worked! </span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(2)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">In fact, this program could help you change any eating behavior in one month</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. That&#x27;s not a lot of time! </span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(3)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The first step is setting goals</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. So take out a piece of paper and write down three eating habits you&#x27;d like to change. </span>"
        ]
      },
