          "<strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">M:</span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> Tired of the same dining experience night after night? Try Fern Hollow Restaurant for a change. </span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(1)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Fern Hollow is the only restaurant in the area that has live music performed by different musical groups every single night</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. And if you love our food but can&#x27;t make it into the restaurant, don&#x27;t worry. You can still enjoy our delicious dishes at your next office function. </span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(2)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Just visit our Web site to book a catering service</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. And, </span><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(3)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">for our regular customers, starting next month, make sure you join our brand - new loyalty program</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">! </span>"
        ]
