          {
            "id": 3,
            "slide_index": 174,
            "question": "<strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Question 03. </span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">What does the magazine offer this week with a subscription? </span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">",
