        "transcript": [
          "<strong>M:</strong> Do you work in the technology industry? Want to <span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">stay updated</span> on the latest industry trends? Subscribe to our online magazine, Tech Now. <strong><span style=\"color: #00B050;\">(1)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span>This month&#x27;s issue is devoted to women who are leaders in the technology field. <strong><span style=\"color: #00B050;\">(2)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span>We&#x27;re pleased to <span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">present</span> an exclusive interview with Erika Cliffton, the founder and CEO of Cliffton Technology Solutions. Erika gives <span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">advice</span> for women starting their own businesses and shares her personal success story. <strong><span style=\"color: #00B050;\">(3)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span>If you <span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">subscribe</span> to Tech Now today, you&#x27;ll receive a free padded carrying case for your laptop. But hurry - the promotion expires in a week."
        ]
