          "<strong>W:</strong> Good afternoon, everyone. <strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(1)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span>I want to compliment you all for your excellent work on the Peterson ad campaign. Their company has already seen a jump in sales from the advertisements we created! Next on the agenda, I want to let you know about a great professional development opportunity. <strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(2)</span></strong> We&#x27;ve decided to start offering reimbursement, covering tuition and other fees, for all employees who take classes at the local business school. <strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(3)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span>And there are lots of great options to choose from. There&#x27;s an interesting evening course called Creative Advertising and it has earned many awards. If you have any questions, let me know."
