        "transcript": [
          "<strong>W: </strong><strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(1)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span>Harper Electronics welcomes you here for a tour of our Innovation Labs, where you&#x27;ll see how we develop new products. We&#x27;ll start with a brief video on the history of the company. Then, you&#x27;ll visit the labs to see the projects we&#x27;re currently working on. <strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(2)</span></strong> The labs themselves are a restricted area, which means no photographs. At 11:00 A.M., we&#x27;ll move to a special visitors conference room. That isn&#x27;t a restricted area. <strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(3)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span>There, you&#x27;ll meet one of Harper Electronics&#x27; lead engineers. She&#x27;ll answer any questions you have to finish up our morning together."
        ]
