          "<strong>M:</strong> Good afternoon. My name is Lawrence Wilson, and <strong><span style=\"color: #00B050;\">(1)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span>I&#x27;ll be conducting the training on how to use our company&#x27;s new scheduling <span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">software</span> - Spark Schedule. <strong><span style=\"color: #00B050;\">(2)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span>The <span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">reason</span> we chose this particular software is because it makes it easy for you to schedule meetings with people in different time zones. That way we can conduct business with our increasing number of clients all over the world. And best of all, <strong><span style=\"color: #00B050;\">(3)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span>there&#x27;s a mobile phone application that you can download <span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">for free</span>. This will allow you to check your schedule from any location."
