          "<strong>W:</strong> <strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(1)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span>Good morning, team. Congratulations on creating such a successful marketing campaign for our Heritage Mill cookies. We&#x27;ve already seen a dramatic increase in this product&#x27;s sales since the launch of the television commercial, so I&#x27;d like you to expand this marketing campaign to our other products as well. <strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(2)</span></strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\"> </span>According to a recent survey, our customers really liked the images of the families eating together that they saw in our commercials. So let&#x27;s keep this concept in mind as we think of ideas for our other products. <strong><span style=\"color: #FF0000;\">(3)</span></strong> We&#x27;ll discuss those ideas at our meeting next week."
